        "heading_H46kJG": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "THE LEGACY CIRCLE",
            "heading_tag": "h1",
            "position": "top_left",
            "highlight_effect": "default",
            "highlight_accent_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "richtext_9B4K8T": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At the centre stands the 2011 ICC World Cup Trophy, rendered with premium embossed treatment and designed like a commemorative championship coin, carrying the mark of <strong>“Champions”.<\/strong><\/p><p>Around it unfolds a complete radial performance map of the Indian squad.<\/p><ul><li>Defining contributions of every squad member across the tournament<\/li><li>Key performances and data encoded into a circular visual system<\/li><li>Final scoreline at the crown: India 277\/4 | Sri Lanka 274\/6<\/li><li>Circular form symbolising the completion of a 28-year journey, from belief to fulfilment<\/li><\/ul><p>The date, the final scoreline, and the inscription <strong>“An Entire Nation Won”<\/strong> seal the composition as the final mark of victory.<\/p><p>History, engineered into form.<\/p>",
            "position": "bottom_left"
          }
        }
      },
